   "textLength": 402,
   "text": "OpenAI is at the forefront of artificial intelligence research, developing systems that can understand and generate human-like text, code, and images. Founded in 2015, they’ve grown from a small research lab to a technology pioneer with over 3,000 employees, shipping products used by hundreds of millions worldwide.\nOpenAIopenai.com ↗\nFoundedSan Francisco, 2015\nSwitchedNovember 2023\nCompany size5,3",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
