   "textLength": 659,
   "text": "The change at OpenAI started small, with individual teams choosing to try Linear. “It’s like a Katamari Ball,” Peal describes. “You get a couple of people to use it and then it snowballs.” From an initial hundred seats, usage grew to over 2,000 people across the organization–and as Peal notes, “it still feels perfectly performant. Search hasn’t slowed, it hasn’t become harder to find things, it’s ",
