   ],
   "textLength": 239,
   "text": "Often tools have a lot of features. This often means people configure a lot of custom workflows, which end up making the tool super slow and hard to use. People shoot themselves in the foot because they do too much.\nGabriel Peal — Engineer",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
