   "textLength": 891,
   "text": "Culture builds slowly, through small actions repeatedly daily. At OpenAI, where speed defines everything, this presented a particular challenge: how do you maintain good habits when moving incredibly fast?\n“Every standup, we would pull up Linear, we’d go through the project, we’d screen cast it, and people would talk about tickets that were ongoing.” Eleti shares. These weren’t dramatic changes–ju",
